{
  "format": "chummy.loop",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "5 step recursive plan",
  "description": "Treats your message as a goal and plans it in 5 steps or fewer. For each step it asks the model whether the step can be done now, by writing or with a tool. If so, it does it and shows the result; if not, it breaks the step into smaller steps and shows the new plan. Steps are worked through breadth-first, and every result is added to one running exchange.",
  "limits": {
    "max_steps": 600,
    "max_llm_calls": 60,
    "max_tool_calls": 30
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "goal",
      "type": "input",
      "label": "Goal",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "goal_text",
      "type": "combine",
      "label": "Goal text",
      "position": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": -160
      },
      "params": {
        "inputs": 1,
        "format": "Goal: _INPUT1_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "exchange",
      "label": "Running exchange",
      "position": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": -160
      },
      "params": {
        "system": "You are working toward the user's goal one step at a time. Keep every answer short and concrete.",
        "roles": [
          "user"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "type": "llm",
      "label": "Make a plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {
        "prompt": "Goal: _INPUT_\n\nWrite a plan to reach this goal in 5 steps or fewer. Make each step as broad or as narrow as it needs to be. Write only the steps, one per line, numbered like:\n1. First step\n2. Second step",
        "system": "You plan how to reach goals. Be concrete and brief.",
        "temperature": 0.3,
        "max_tokens": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "steps",
      "type": "capture",
      "label": "Steps",
      "position": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {
        "pattern": "(?m)^\\s*\\d+[.)]\\s*(.+?)\\s*$"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "show_plan",
      "type": "combine",
      "label": "Plan message",
      "position": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 300
      },
      "params": {
        "inputs": 1,
        "format": "**Plan**\n\n_INPUT1_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_plan",
      "type": "output",
      "label": "Show plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 300
      },
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "first",
      "type": "for_each",
      "label": "Up to 5 steps",
      "position": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {
        "limit": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "queue",
      "type": "forward",
      "label": "Steps to do",
      "position": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pair",
      "type": "augment",
      "label": "Next step",
      "position": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": -60
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "user",
        "format": "Step: _INPUT_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_can",
      "type": "augment",
      "label": "Ask: doable now?",
      "position": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "user",
        "format": "Can you complete this step right now, either by writing the result yourself or with your tools (reading, writing, listing and searching files in the workspace, fetching a web page, calculating, or checking the date and time)?\n\nStep: _INPUT_\n\nAnswer YES or NO."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "can",
      "type": "llm",
      "label": "Doable now?",
      "position": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 120
      },
      "params": {
        "system": "Answer with only YES or NO.",
        "temperature": 0.0,
        "max_tokens": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "decide",
      "type": "branch",
      "label": "Doable?",
      "position": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": -60
      },
      "params": {
        "pattern": "(?i)^\\W*yes"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "do",
      "type": "function",
      "label": "Do the step",
      "position": {
        "x": 2540,
        "y": -260
      },
      "params": {
        "function": "do_step"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step_name",
      "type": "read_exchange",
      "label": "Step name",
      "position": {
        "x": 2540,
        "y": -460
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record",
      "type": "augment",
      "label": "Add result",
      "position": {
        "x": 2840,
        "y": -420
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "format": "_INPUT_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "show_result",
      "type": "combine",
      "label": "Result message",
      "position": {
        "x": 2840,
        "y": -240
      },
      "params": {
        "inputs": 2,
        "format": "**✓ _INPUT1_**\n\n_INPUT2_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_result",
      "type": "output",
      "label": "Show result",
      "position": {
        "x": 3120,
        "y": -240
      },
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "split",
      "type": "function",
      "label": "Break it down",
      "position": {
        "x": 2540,
        "y": 160
      },
      "params": {
        "function": "break_down"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "split_name",
      "type": "read_exchange",
      "label": "Step name",
      "position": {
        "x": 2540,
        "y": 380
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "record_split",
      "type": "augment",
      "label": "Add new plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 2840,
        "y": 100
      },
      "params": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "format": "I broke this step into smaller steps:\n_INPUT_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "more",
      "type": "for_each",
      "label": "Up to 5 sub-steps",
      "position": {
        "x": 2840,
        "y": 280
      },
      "params": {
        "limit": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "show_split",
      "type": "combine",
      "label": "New plan message",
      "position": {
        "x": 3120,
        "y": 400
      },
      "params": {
        "inputs": 2,
        "format": "**Breaking down _INPUT1_**\n\n_INPUT2_"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_split",
      "type": "output",
      "label": "Show new plan",
      "position": {
        "x": 3400,
        "y": 400
      },
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "goal",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "goal_text",
        "port": "in1"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "goal",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "plan",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "goal_text",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "start",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "start",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "plan",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "steps",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "plan",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "show_plan",
        "port": "in1"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "show_plan",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "reply_plan",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "steps",
        "port": "group1"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "first",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "first",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "queue",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "queue",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "queue",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "ask_can",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "ask_can",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "ask_can",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "can",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "can",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "test"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "yes"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "do",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "yes"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "record",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "yes"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "step_name",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "do",
        "port": "result"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "record",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "do",
        "port": "result"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "show_result",
        "port": "in2"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "step_name",
        "port": "last"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "show_result",
        "port": "in1"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "show_result",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "reply_result",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "record",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "no"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "split",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "no"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "record_split",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "decide",
        "port": "no"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "split_name",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "split",
        "port": "plan"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "record_split",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "split",
        "port": "plan"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "show_split",
        "port": "in2"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "split",
        "port": "steps"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "more",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "more",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "queue",
        "port": "in"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "record_split",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "pair",
        "port": "exchange"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "split_name",
        "port": "last"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "show_split",
        "port": "in1"
      }
    },
    {
      "from": {
        "block": "show_split",
        "port": "out"
      },
      "to": {
        "block": "reply_split",
        "port": "in"
      }
    }
  ],
  "functions": [
    {
      "id": "do_step",
      "name": "Do the step",
      "description": "The model does one step, calling tools as often as it needs, and gives the result.",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "exchange",
          "label": "Exchange",
          "to": {
            "block": "work",
            "port": "in"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "result",
          "label": "Result",
          "from": {
            "block": "work",
            "port": "out"
          }
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "work",
          "type": "llm",
          "label": "Work on the step",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "params": {
            "system": "Do the user's latest step now. Use a tool if it helps; otherwise just write the result. Keep the result short.",
            "max_tokens": 800,
            "tools": [
              "read_file",
              "write_file",
              "list_files",
              "search_files",
              "fetch_page",
              "calculator",
              "current_time"
            ],
            "retries": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "run",
          "type": "run_tool",
          "label": "Run tool",
          "position": {
            "x": 320,
            "y": 180
          },
          "params": {
            "max_result_chars": 4000
          }
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "work",
            "port": "tool"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "run",
            "port": "in"
          }
        },
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "run",
            "port": "out"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "work",
            "port": "in"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "break_down",
      "name": "Break it down",
      "description": "Plans 5 or fewer smaller steps for a step that's too big.",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "name": "exchange",
          "label": "Exchange",
          "to": {
            "block": "entry",
            "port": "in"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "plan",
          "label": "New plan",
          "from": {
            "block": "sub",
            "port": "out"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "steps",
          "label": "Steps",
          "from": {
            "block": "parse",
            "port": "group1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "entry",
          "type": "forward",
          "label": "Exchange",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "params": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "which",
          "type": "read_exchange",
          "label": "Which step",
          "position": {
            "x": 280,
            "y": 160
          },
          "params": {
            "role": "user"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "type": "augment",
          "label": "Ask for smaller steps",
          "position": {
            "x": 560,
            "y": 0
          },
          "params": {
            "role": "user",
            "format": "_INPUT_\n\nThis step is too big to do in one go. Break it into 5 or fewer smaller steps, as broad or as narrow as each needs to be. Write only the steps, one per line, numbered like:\n1. First smaller step\n2. Second smaller step"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sub",
          "type": "llm",
          "label": "Plan smaller steps",
          "position": {
            "x": 840,
            "y": 0
          },
          "params": {
            "temperature": 0.3,
            "max_tokens": 400
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "parse",
          "type": "capture",
          "label": "Steps",
          "position": {
            "x": 1120,
            "y": 0
          },
          "params": {
            "pattern": "(?m)^\\s*\\d+[.)]\\s*(.+?)\\s*$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "entry",
            "port": "out"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "ask",
            "port": "exchange"
          }
        },
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "entry",
            "port": "out"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "which",
            "port": "in"
          }
        },
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "which",
            "port": "last"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "ask",
            "port": "in"
          }
        },
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "ask",
            "port": "out"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "sub",
            "port": "in"
          }
        },
        {
          "from": {
            "block": "sub",
            "port": "out"
          },
          "to": {
            "block": "parse",
            "port": "in"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
